<title>UK: Lamont says hard to cut taxes in UK budget.</title>
<headline>Lamont says hard to cut taxes in UK budget.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former British Chancellor of the Exchequer, Norman Lamont, said on Monday it was hard to cut taxes in Tuesday's budget when government borrowing was high.</p>
</text>
